desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Ocamllint Filenameconcat"
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Filenameconcat"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-ocamllint-filenameconcat"
	risk: "path-traversal"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
When attacker supplied data is passed to Filename.concat directory traversal attacks might be possible.

### 风险类型
路径遍历（path-traversal）

### 影响
用户输入未校验即用于文件路径，可能读取或写入任意文件。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-35: Path Traversal
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
规范化路径并校验其位于允许目录内，避免直接拼接用户输入。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ml": <<<POS
Filename.concat
POS
	"safefile://pos.ml": <<<NEG
Filename.quote_command
NEG
)

${*.ml}.pattern_regex(/(?:Filename\.concat)/) as $p0
${*.mli}.pattern_regex(/(?:Filename\.concat)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Ocamllint Filenameconcat",
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Filenameconcat",
	message: "Ocamllint Filenameconcat detected.",
}
